Z||000000||RiceCooker||12-19-2000||05:26 PM||||		ALIVE<P><BR>What is this sound, this awakening noise?<BR>Have I forgotten my strength, my poise?<BR>It is much too loud, this cry in my head<BR>Could I not have heard it? Was I dead?<BR>All too often I have hit the snooze<BR>Will it ever heal? This substantial bruise?<BR>For the bruise is deep and the scars are thick<BR>The process is tough and it will not be quick<P>I must regain the will, the ultimate drive<BR>To be fair to myself, to be Alive<P>Though I will be back, it will not be soon<BR>I must first realize what problems have loomed<BR>The way out of this deadly quicksand<BR>Is to realize why, to understand<BR>For I know now, but I did not then<BR>Who, what, how, where, why and when<BR>The path to my heart blocked the path to my mind<BR>I must use these together, I am beginning to find<P>A beautiful body and mind, for this I will strive<BR>My heart and soul will never feel more Alive<P>A great lesson learned, much too cliché<BR>Is that good things will go, while great things will stay<BR>Some things are so great, we must not forget<BR>Life is far to short to feel regret<BR>Changes are made the door opens wide<BR>The invitation is given, time to step inside<P>A bright star on the horizon has been sighted<BR>The passion is present, the fire ignited<BR>We must not forget, no matter how great the bribe<BR>We must reach deep inside to feel the vibe<P>The dreams are the inspiration to the drive<BR>The goals are for what we strive <BR>We will overcome, we will thrive<BR>For everyday, we are so ALIVE<BR>||||reg||1
