Z||000003||RiceCooker||12-20-2000||03:07 PM||||Thanks guys.<P>I always hated English and poetry in school. The last two years though, I always wrote it for my gf cause she loved it and it was a great way to show my appreciation, etc, etc. <BR>Anyways, now that we're broken up, I've found that writing this kind of stuff makes me feel great and I just want the whole world to read it cause maybe it will inspire someone or just give somebody a better day.<P>Anyways, I have another one if you didn't already read it. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/001043.html" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/001043.html</A> <P>I have more too if anyone's interested<P>Life's too short to be pi$$ed off or worried or scared of anything, eh?<P>Later,<BR>Todd ||||reg||1
